Swow MongoDB Extension
https://github.com/swow/swow-mongodb-extension

This distribution is based on the MongoDB PHP Driver and its bundled C libraries.
Copyright notices and licenses from MongoDB, Inc. and all other upstream contributors
remain in the source files, LICENSE, CREDITS and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

The Swow project modified the PHP driver and bundled libmongoc to provide an optional,
versioned cooperative runtime interface and native-client operation protection.
The PHP module name, protocol, BSON processing, native transport ownership and original
client persistence remain with the driver. This is not an official MongoDB release.

The source includes third-party software with its original notices and licenses.
See src/libmongoc/COPYING, src/libmongoc/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES and
src/libmongocrypt/LICENSE, in addition to licenses retained in individual source files.

This product includes PHP software, freely available from http://www.php.net/software/.
